      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.2cor.bohairic:01",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉⲣⲉⲛⲁⲓ ϭⲉ ⲟⲩⲟⲛϩ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ϣϣⲉ ⲉⲣⲱⲧⲛ ⲉⲧⲣⲉⲧⲛⲥⲙⲛ ⲧⲏⲩⲧⲛ . ⲛⲧⲉⲧⲛⲧⲙⲣⲗⲁⲁⲩ ⲛϩⲱⲃ ϩⲛⲟⲩ**ⲁⲥⲁⲓ** .",
      "english": "Seeing then that these things can't be denied, you ought to be quiet, and to do nothing rash.",
      "source": "44_Acts of the Apostles_19",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.acts.sahidica:19",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
